==Description==
The '''VIPPlus Nametag''' is an animated nametag given to anyone who subscribed to [[VIP+]].

The '''VIPPlus Nametag''' has yellow and purple gradient text with a black outline. Coins, gems and sparks are emitted from the '''VIPPlus Nametag'''. Above the nametag, there is a golden crown. The text for the nametag moves up down in a wave.

